&gt;#开源&lt;/a&gt; 的这个能长久存活：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://masto2rss.gedanken.uber.space/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://masto2rss.gedanken.uber.space/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;发现于&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://scholar.social/@gedankenstuecke/113322700501308956" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;https://scholar.social/@gedankenstuecke/113322700501308956&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn1.telesco.pe/file/tkedGgxDil5GZQ2uAOhhQZLS-gC1I-nAwxzGc4gPwiWGTqbQys1QRwey90WGadTtVeuqxm5ti_k37oPLcWV7q9h3Wi3Hn14LLgLDjNE9pAkVyZ-xM5IPA_WEEq-5R01bseEoI8Fc42ozmn1nhwz3y2h0PgkZo1xTut73fPLP94RQ-KXl8ytWwt7wUkuA_08-zUBNOpj10zTkWrbPLvlRIAwY3wMcgzXZehgeoduZ1RYfbokKZE_TEgUIuavx_vTE5b4UlNSVa4pwLHvfReEnVH55hIfCgDU8ub3dGDvWFIyoIR5EVtubodzyF0y_x1NbrOCQyhPDsXuvGvXRcfPkvg.jpg" width="552" height="239" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;</description><link>https://t.me/aboutrss/1510</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://t.me/aboutrss/1510</guid><pubDate>Mon, 07 Apr 2025 12:02:52 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>